expose-sub checkFindingDetailSchema, CheckFindingDetail, reviewAttemptViewSchema, ReviewAttemptView from harness to descendants
expose-sub reviewRequestViewSchema, ReviewRequestView, reviewListResponseSchema, ReviewListResponse from harness to descendants
expose-sub respondToCheckFindingCommandSchema, RespondToCheckFindingCommand, waiveCheckFindingCommandSchema from harness to descendants
expose-sub WaiveCheckFindingCommand, revokeCheckFindingWaiverCommandSchema, RevokeCheckFindingWaiverCommand from harness to descendants
